    "metadata_synthesis":  "Unforgiving and sharp. Scorching truth. No apologies. Record of a Night Too Brief",
    "setting_and_subculture":  "Bleak landscapes. Concrete shadows. Sterile rooms. Cold fluorescent hum.",
    "visual_tone_and_feel":  "Uncomfortable close-ups. Uncomfortable close-ups.",
    "media_era_tone":  "Cynical edge. Unfiltered noise. Rejecting the glossy mainstream.",
    "pacing_and_structure":  "Fragmented memory. Jagged cuts. Relentless. Slow-burn to violent climax.",
    "atmosphere_and_mood":  "Sweat-stained. Paranoia creeping in. The air is thick with unspoken trauma.",
    "themes_and_messages":  "Generational scars. Silence as a weapon. The illusion of safety shattered.",
    "character_relationships":  "Fractured. Toxic codependency. Silent orbits. Collisions of ego.",
    "lead_character_type":  "Broken. Unreliable. Carrying weight of past sins. Hollow shell. Running on fumes.",
    "story_and_plot_type":  "Descent into hell. Unraveling human cruelty. Descent into hell. Unraveling human cruelty.",
    "who_and_when":  "Those who stare into the abyss. Late night consumption.",
    "emotional_evocation":  "Gut-wrenching. Leaves a metallic taste. Pure dread."
